Paseo Theme Studio

Includes a React Native preview adapted from the visual structure and theme mappings of Paseo:
https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo
Source reference: v0.9.2

Paseo is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The preview and integration are local modifications and are not an official Paseo product.

Community starting palettes are adapted from themes published in the T3 Themes gallery:
https://t3themes.com (https://github.com/SunkenInTime/t3-themes)
Each palette names its author in shared/community-presets.ts and in the Packs inspector.
T3 Themes and Theme Studio are not affiliated with T3 Tools.
